
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Syne:wght@400;700;800&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont@latest/tabler-icons.min.css">
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
:root{
  --gold:#C9A84C;
  --gold2:#E8CC6A;
  --dark:#0A0805;
  --dark2:#111009;
  --panel:#15120A;
  --panel2:#1C1810;
  --border:rgba(201,168,76,0.18);
  --border2:rgba(201,168,76,0.35);
  --text:#F0E8D0;
  --muted:#7A6E58;
  --active-bg:rgba(201,168,76,0.12);
}
body{background:var(--dark);color:var(--text);font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;min-height:600px;overflow:hidden}
h1,h2,h3,h4{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif}

.app{display:flex;height:600px}

.sidebar{width:220px;min-width:220px;background:var(--panel);border-right:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:0}
.logo{padding:20px 18px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.logo-title{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;color:var(--gold);letter-spacing:2px}
.logo-sub{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:3px;margin-top:2px}

.nav{flex:1;padding:12px 8px;overflow-y:auto}
.nav-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);transition:all 0.2s;border:1px solid transparent;margin-bottom:2px;font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif}
.nav-item:hover{color:var(--gold);background:var(--active-bg);border-color:var(--border)}
.nav-item.active{color:var(--gold);background:var(--active-bg);border-color:var(--border2)}
.nav-item i{font-size:16px;width:20px;text-align:center}
.nav-label{font-size:12px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.5px}

.nav-section{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:2px;padding:12px 12px 4px;opacity:0.6}

.sidebar-footer{padding:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
.status-dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#4ade80;box-shadow:0 0 6px #4ade80;display:inline-block;margin-right:6px}
.status-text{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}

.main{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden}

.topbar{padding:16px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;background:var(--panel)}
.topbar-title{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;color:var(--text)}
.topbar-sub{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:1px}
.btn-activate{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold),#8B6520);color:#0A0805;font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:6px;border:none;cursor:pointer;transition:opacity 0.2s}
.btn-activate:hover{opacity:0.85}

.content{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:16px 20px}

.section-dash{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px}
.metric-card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px}
.metric-label{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px}
.metric-value{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--gold)}
.metric-delta{font-size:10px;color:#4ade80;margin-top:2px}

.modules-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px}
.module-card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:14px;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.module-card::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:2px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,var(--gold),transparent);opacity:0;transition:opacity 0.2s}
.module-card:hover{border-color:var(--border2);background:var(--panel2)}
.module-card:hover::before{opacity:1}
.module-icon{font-size:22px;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:8px}
.module-title{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:4px}
.module-desc{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.4}
.module-badge{position:absolute;top:10px;right:10px;font-size:9px;background:var(--active-bg);border:1px solid var(--border2);color:var(--gold);padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;letter-spacing:0.5px}

.chat-section{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden}
.chat-header{padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.chat-title{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700}
.chat-messages{height:160px;overflow-y:auto;padding:12px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.chat-messages::-webkit-scrollbar{width:3px}
.chat-messages::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:var(--border2);border-radius:2px}
.msg{max-width:88%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}
.msg-ia{align-self:flex-start}
.msg-user{align-self:flex-end;align-items:flex-end}
.msg-bubble{padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5}
.msg-ia .msg-bubble{background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text)}
.msg-user .msg-bubble{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold),#8B6520);color:#0A0805;font-weight:500}
.msg-name{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);padding:0 4px}
.chat-input-row{padding:10px 12px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;gap:8px}
.chat-input{flex:1;background:var(--dark);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:7px;color:var(--text);font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:12px;padding:8px 12px;outline:none;transition:border-color 0.2s}
.chat-input:focus{border-color:var(--border2)}
.chat-input::placeholder{color:var(--muted)}
.btn-send{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold),#8B6520);color:#0A0805;border:none;border-radius:7px;padding:8px 14px;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:11px;transition:opacity 0.2s;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.btn-send:disabled{opacity:0.5;cursor:not-allowed}
.btn-send:hover:not(:disabled){opacity:0.85}

.typing{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;padding:6px 12px}
.typing span{width:5px;height:5px;background:var(--gold);border-radius:50%;animation:bounce 1.2s infinite}
.typing span:nth-child(2){animation-delay:0.2s}
.typing span:nth-child(3){animation-delay:0.4s}
@keyframes bounce{0%,60%,100%{transform:translateY(0)}30%{transform:translateY(-5px)}}

.page{display:none}
.page.active{display:block}

.module-full{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:16px;margin-bottom:14px}
.module-full-header{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px}
.module-full-icon{font-size:24px;color:var(--gold)}
.module-full-title{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:700}
.module-full-desc{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}

.quick-btns{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-bottom:10px}
.quick-btn{background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:5px;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s;font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif}
.quick-btn:hover{color:var(--gold);border-color:var(--border2)}

.back-btn{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;margin-bottom:14px;transition:color 0.2s;width:fit-content}
.back-btn:hover{color:var(--gold)}

.viral-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-bottom:10px}
.viral-card{background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:12px;cursor:pointer;transition:border-color 0.2s}
.viral-card:hover{border-color:var(--border2)}
.viral-card-title{font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:4px}
.viral-card-sub{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted)}

.funnel-steps{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;margin-bottom:12px}
.funnel-step{background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.funnel-step-num{width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--active-bg);border:1px solid var(--border2);color:var(--gold);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;font-family:'Syne',sans-serif}
.funnel-step-text{font-size:12px;color:var(--text)}
.funnel-step-sub{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted)}

.biblioteca-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px}
.bib-card{background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:12px;cursor:pointer;transition:border-color 0.2s}
.bib-card:hover{border-color:var(--border2)}
.bib-card i{font-size:18px;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:6px}
.bib-card-title{font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:var(--text)}
.bib-card-sub{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}

.training-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
.training-item{background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.training-name{font-size:12px;color:var(--text)}
.training-badge{font-size:10px;background:var(--active-bg);border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--gold);padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px}
.training-done{background:rgba(74,222,128,0.1);border-color:rgba(74,222,128,0.3);color:#4ade80}

.gold-text{color:var(--gold)}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h2 class="sr-only" style="position:absolute;left:-9999px">ONE MORE AI System — Hub Central para network marketing y wellness</h2>

<div class="app">
  <aside class="sidebar">
    <div class="logo">
      <div class="logo-title">ONE MORE</div>
      <div class="logo-sub">AI SYSTEM</div>
    </div>
    <nav class="nav">
      <div class="nav-section">PRINCIPAL</div>
      <div class="nav-item active" data-page="dashboard">
        <i class="ti ti-layout-dashboard"></i>
        <span class="nav-label">Dashboard</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nav-item" data-page="mentor">
        <i class="ti ti-robot"></i>
        <span class="nav-label">IA Mentor</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nav-section">CONTENIDO</div>
      <div class="nav-item" data-page="viral">
        <i class="ti ti-flame"></i>
        <span class="nav-label">Viral Machine</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nav-item" data-page="funnel">
        <i class="ti ti-message-chatbot"></i>
        <span class="nav-label">Funnel WhatsApp</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nav-section">EQUIPO</div>
      <div class="nav-item" data-page="training">
        <i class="ti ti-school"></i>
        <span class="nav-label">Training Center</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nav-item" data-page="biblioteca">
        <i class="ti ti-books"></i>
        <span class="nav-label">Biblioteca</span>
      </div>
    </nav>
    <div class="sidebar-footer">
      <span class="status-dot"></span>
      <span class="status-text">IA activa · Claude Sonnet</span>
    </div>
  </aside>

  <div class="main">
    <div class="topbar">
      <div>
        <div class="topbar-title" id="topbar-title">Hub Central IA</div>
        <div class="topbar-sub" id="topbar-sub">Dashboard operativo ONE MORE</div>
      </div>
      <button class="btn-activate">⚡ ACTIVAR IA</button>
    </div>

    <div class="content">

      <!-- DASHBOARD -->
      <div class="page active" id="page-dashboard">
        <div class="section-dash">
          <div class="metric-card">
            <div class="metric-label">Tu Rango</div>
            <div class="metric-value">Gold</div>
            <div class="metric-delta">▲ Próximo: Platinum</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-card">
            <div class="metric-label">QV Activo</div>
            <div class="metric-value">320</div>
            <div class="metric-delta">▲ +80 esta semana</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-card">
            <div class="metric-label">Red Activa</div>
            <div class="metric-value">12</div>
            <div class="metric-delta">▲ 3 nuevos socios</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="modules-grid">
          <div class="module-card" data-nav="mentor">
            <div class="module-badge">IA</div>
            <div class="module-icon"><i class="ti ti-robot" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
            <div class="module-title">IA Mentor</div>
            <div class="module-desc">Consulta el ecosistema One More con IA en tiempo real.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="module-card" data-nav="viral">
            <div class="module-badge">HOT</div>
            <div class="module-icon"><i class="ti ti-flame" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
            <div class="module-title">Viral Machine</div>
            <div class="module-desc">Hooks, guiones TikTok, Reels y storytelling.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="module-card" data-nav="funnel">
            <div class="module-icon"><i class="ti ti-message-chatbot" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
            <div class="module-title">Funnel WhatsApp</div>
            <div class="module-desc">Secuencia 7 días para convertir prospectos.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="module-card" data-nav="training">
            <div class="module-icon"><i class="ti ti-school" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
            <div class="module-title">Training Center</div>
            <div class="module-desc">Onboarding y capacitación para nuevos socios.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="module-card" data-nav="biblioteca">
            <div class="module-icon"><i class="ti ti-books" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
            <div class="module-title">Biblioteca Wellness</div>
            <div class="module-desc">Vademécum, protocolos y productos.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="module-card">
            <div class="module-badge">PRONTO</div>
            <div class="module-icon"><i class="ti ti-settings-automation" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
            <div class="module-title">Automatización</div>
            <div class="module-desc">Make.com, Telegram y flujos automáticos.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="chat-section">
          <div class="chat-header">
            <i class="ti ti-sparkles" style="color:var(--gold);font-size:16px" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <span class="chat-title">Consulta Rápida al Sistema</span>
          </div>
          <div class="chat-messages" id="chat-msgs-dash">
            <div class="msg msg-ia">
              <span class="msg-name">ONE MORE IA</span>
              <div class="msg-bubble">Hola José, soy tu asistente ONE MORE. Pregúntame sobre producto, negocio, contenido o duplicación. Estoy aquí para escalar tu red. 🚀</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="chat-input-row">
            <input class="chat-input" id="input-dash" placeholder="Ej: dame un guion para explicar el Bono 2+1..." />
            <button class="btn-send" id="send-dash">
              <i class="ti ti-send" aria-hidden="true"></i> Enviar
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- IA MENTOR -->
      <div class="page" id="page-mentor">
        <div class="module-full">
          <div class="module-full-header">
            <i class="ti ti-robot module-full-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <div>
              <div class="module-full-title">IA Mentor — Experto ONE MORE</div>
              <div class="module-full-desc">Consultor especializado en producto, negocio y duplicación</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="quick-btns">
            <button class="quick-btn" onclick="askMentor('Explícame el sistema de compensación One More')">💰 Compensación</button>
            <button class="quick-btn" onclick="askMentor('¿Cómo funciona el parche transdérmico One More?')">🩹 Producto</button>
            <button class="quick-btn" onclick="askMentor('¿Cómo hacer el Bono 2+1 paso a paso?')">🎯 Bono 2+1</button>
            <button class="quick-btn" onclick="askMentor('Estrategia para pasar de Gold a Platinum')">⬆️ Subir rango</button>
            <button class="quick-btn" onclick="askMentor('Script para invitar a una presentación de negocio')">📲 Script invitación</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="chat-section" style="height:320px;display:flex;flex-direction:column">
          <div class="chat-messages" id="chat-msgs-mentor" style="flex:1;height:auto">
            <div class="msg msg-ia">
              <span class="msg-name">IA Mentor ONE MORE</span>
              <div class="msg-bubble">Soy tu experto en el ecosistema ONE MORE. Tengo conocimiento profundo de productos transdérmicos, plan de compensación, rangos y estrategias de duplicación. ¿Qué necesitas?</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="chat-input-row">
            <input class="chat-input" id="input-mentor" placeholder="Consulta sobre producto, negocio o estrategia..." />
            <button class="btn-send" id="send-mentor"><i class="ti ti-send" aria-hidden="true"></i> Enviar</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- VIRAL MACHINE -->
      <div class="page" id="page-viral">
        <div class="module-full">
          <div class="module-full-header">
            <i class="ti ti-flame module-full-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <div>
              <div class="module-full-title">Viral Machine — Contenido que Convierte</div>
              <div class="module-full-desc">Genera hooks, guiones y storytelling para redes sociales</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="viral-grid">
            <div class="viral-card" onclick="askViral('Crea 5 hooks virales para TikTok sobre los parches One More')">
              <div class="viral-card-title"><i class="ti ti-brand-tiktok" style="color:var(--gold)"></i> Hooks TikTok</div>
              <div class="viral-card-sub">5 aperturas que detienen el scroll</div>
            </div>
            <div class="viral-card" onclick="askViral('Escribe un guion de 60 segundos para Reel de Instagram sobre libertad financiera con One More')">
              <div class="viral-card-title"><i class="ti ti-brand-instagram" style="color:var(--gold)"></i> Guion Reel</div>
              <div class="viral-card-sub">60 segundos de alto impacto</div>
            </div>
            <div class="viral-card" onclick="askViral('Crea una historia de transformación real para WhatsApp Status sobre bienestar y One More')">
              <div class="viral-card-title"><i class="ti ti-brand-whatsapp" style="color:var(--gold)"></i> Story WhatsApp</div>
              <div class="viral-card-sub">Narrativa de transformación</div>
            </div>
            <div class="viral-card" onclick="askViral('Escribe un caption viral para Facebook sobre el estilo de vida One More, con llamada a la acción')">
              <div class="viral-card-title"><i class="ti ti-brand-facebook" style="color:var(--gold)"></i> Caption Facebook</div>
              <div class="viral-card-sub">Post de alto alcance orgánico</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="chat-section" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column">
          <div class="chat-messages" id="chat-msgs-viral" style="height:220px">
            <div class="msg msg-ia">
              <span class="msg-name">Viral Machine</span>
              <div class="msg-bubble">Selecciona un formato arriba o descríbeme qué contenido necesitas. Te genero guiones, hooks y copys listos para publicar. 🎬</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="chat-input-row">
            <input class="chat-input" id="input-viral" placeholder="Ej: hook para explicar qué es un parche transdérmico..." />
            <button class="btn-send" id="send-viral"><i class="ti ti-send" aria-hidden="true"></i> Generar</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FUNNEL WHATSAPP -->
      <div class="page" id="page-funnel">
        <div class="module-full">
          <div class="module-full-header">
            <i class="ti ti-message-chatbot module-full-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <div>
              <div class="module-full-title">Funnel WhatsApp — 7 Días de Conversión</div>
              <div class="module-full-desc">Secuencia lista para transformar un contacto en socio activo</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="funnel-steps" id="funnel-steps">
            <div class="funnel-step" onclick="askFunnel(1)">
              <div class="funnel-step-num">1</div>
              <div><div class="funnel-step-text">Primer contacto — Generación de curiosidad</div><div class="funnel-step-sub">Mensaje de apertura sin vender</div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="funnel-step" onclick="askFunnel(2)">
              <div class="funnel-step-num">2</div>
              <div><div class="funnel-step-text">Seguimiento — Compartir historia de resultado</div><div class="funnel-step-sub">Prueba social y testimonial</div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="funnel-step" onclick="askFunnel(3)">
              <div class="funnel-step-num">3</div>
              <div><div class="funnel-step-text">Educación — Valor del producto transdérmico</div><div class="funnel-step-sub">Info sin abrumar al prospecto</div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="funnel-step" onclick="askFunnel(4)">
              <div class="funnel-step-num">4</div>
              <div><div class="funnel-step-text">Oportunidad — Presentar el negocio</div><div class="funnel-step-sub">Invitación a Zoom o video</div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="funnel-step" onclick="askFunnel(5)">
              <div class="funnel-step-num">5</div>
              <div><div class="funnel-step-text">Objeciones — Manejo de dudas frecuentes</div><div class="funnel-step-sub">Respuestas a "es muy caro", "no tengo tiempo"</div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="funnel-step" onclick="askFunnel(6)">
              <div class="funnel-step-num">6</div>
              <div><div class="funnel-step-text">Urgencia — Cierre suave con beneficio</div><div class="funnel-step-sub">Mensaje de escasez ético</div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="funnel-step" onclick="askFunnel(7)">
